    {
      "text": "Jinzan grass is an irreplaceable war resource for Jin clan, used as a refinement material so the clan can produce large numbers of golden silkworm Gu. At this visit the clan is still fixing that recipe, yet already grows three acres of Jinzan grass. In Fang Yuan’s prior-life memory, Jin clan later uses rank three golden silkworm Gu to eliminate Huang Clan and dominate Huang Jin mountain.",
